      "note": "The vulnerable type stores fields inline as `vcardstrarray *field[VCARD_MAX_STRUCTURED_FIELDS]` with VCARD_MAX_STRUCTURED_FIELDS set to 20 in vcardstructuredimpl.h. Each ';' separator creates another field and immediately executes `st->field[st->num_fields++] = field;` without any bound check or resizing.",
